  "title": "My Favorite Grilled Chicken Ever",
  "description": "Here&#39;s your new favorite grilled chicken recipe made with bone-in cuts and an easy marinade of white vinegar, garlic, butter, and Worcestershire sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "stylingmom"
  ],
